Cell["2. Matching", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7be0587d-dd10-fc4a-a5a2-c760c8d4b953"],

Cell["\<\
Before anything is rewritten, the input has to be found. \
HypergraphRuleMatches gives the ways it sits inside a hypergraph, and nothing \
else:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"31cc2d98-870a-5348-9f0c-4d43b1d591f6"],

