05d6-a64d-80c8-066e23575d50"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "An unlabelled pattern being a wildcard is what makes a rule written for \
skeletons work unchanged on a labelled hypergraph. The alternative \
\[LongDash] requiring a pattern to be unlabelled in order to match an \
unlabelled edge \[LongDash] would mean writing two versions of every rule."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"e9e36dba-c909-904a-87eb-491018c8faa1"],

Cell["\<\
The output's labels are carried onto the edges it makes, so a rule can label \
what it builds:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a1bc80bd-0b8c-c24e-9083-5f6d861a8357"],

Cell["\<\
tag = HypergraphRule[{{1, 2}}, {Edge[{1, 3}, \"Directed\", \"first\"],
                           Edge[{3, 2}, \"Directed\", \"second\"]}];
First[tag[Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}]}]]][\"Hypergraph\"]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"2481a384-3137-c84f-aa8c-aa455e4b504b"],

