  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Choosing the first event each time is a choice made by hand, and it is \
exactly the choice a multiway system refuses to make: it keeps all of them, \
and the branching that results is what its evolution graph draws. Doing it by \
hand here shows what there is to keep."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"9d6839d4-31ab-cd45-9849-4c7a2970b068"],

Cell["A rule with no match", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"9f0b7778-3d2b-a542-a934-f84b2e894ec0"],

Cell["\<\
A rule that does not apply gives no events, which is not a failure but an \
answer:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5034d6e5-744d-de42-b58a-f5d804e42aea"],

Cell["contract[Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}]}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"22e985d6-8d7a-3a46-810f-c163129b9cf8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"2608104b-b40d-ce44-9a7e-7eb0c43540e1"],

Cell["Every state one step away", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d1390f45-b1f6-cf4c-be0c-e4cb7b50798e"],

Cell["\<\
All the events at once, from a slightly larger hypergraph, as the states they \
lead to:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d0aaa814-284a-d240-8869-a0257c0f399a"],

Cell["\<\
star = Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}], Edge[{1, 3}], Edge[{1, 4}]}]\
