    PlotRange->{{0., 1.6329931618554523`}, {0., 1.6329931618554523`}},
    PlotRangePadding->Scaled[0.02]]}], "}"}]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->\
"42c791a5-805e-c54a-adb3-71e4a0fc8fc5"],

Cell["\<\
Three events, one per edge. They are distinct as events but isomorphic as \
hypergraphs, which CanonicalHypergraph makes plain:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d8526890-461b-7845-a098-678072899aba"],

Cell["\<\
Length @ DeleteDuplicates[CanonicalHypergraph[#[\"Hypergraph\"]] & /@ \
sub[star]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"f90bdb8a-68d4-f649-8766-b9c96c426c43"],

Cell[BoxData["1"], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"f9de2250-47eb-0248-980b-1dde9e6c87a7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Design note.  ",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "Distinct events with isomorphic results is the ordinary situation, not a \
special case, and it is why a multiway system has to decide whether its \
states are hypergraphs or isomorphism classes of them. The pieces for either \
reading are already here."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 0}, {6, 6}},
 CellFrameColor->GrayLevel[0.7],
 FontColor->GrayLevel[
  0.25],ExpressionUUID->"e30863e6-83dd-9846-a61a-92ae220b6235"],

Cell["An unordered rule", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"b210cd88-5a8a-794c-8bc0-1887dc02ad41"],

Cell["\<\
Nothing about rewriting is particular to directed edges. Here an unordered \
pair becomes an unordered triple:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dd3a85d7-e41b-4641-8c94-edf26ec74abf"],

Cell["\<\
grow = HypergraphRule[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Unordered\"]},
                      {Edge[{1, 2, 3}, \"Unordered\"]}];
Length @ grow[Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \"Unordered\"]}]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"755c72fd-a0be-4449-9e32-7e0b5ed52398"],

Cell[BoxData["2"], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"6c461442-db5b-d848-b59e-39ad9c5184ef"],

Cell["\<\
Two events, from the two orderings the unordered pattern admits, and their \
results are the same hypergraph:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e4678b4f-2a2e-b146-a268-650b981f674e"],

Cell["\<\
DeleteDuplicates[#[\"Hypergraph\"] & /@ grow[Hypergraph[{Edge[{1, 2}, \
\"Unordered\"]}]]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"3dc3d544-e8c8-2a4d-8792-e70a1b1a5078"],

